      300.59
    ],
    "text": "(l)to do all such other acts and things as are necessary,conducive or incidental to the attainment of all orany of the objects of the Corporation as stated aboveand at the discretion of the rightful descendants ofsuccessors of the Late Founder of the Al-JamiathulGhawsiyyah His Holiness Assaiyyidh AshheikhAbdur Rasheed Koya Thangal Al-Qadhiriyyah War-Rifa\u2019iyyah (Qaddasallahu Sirrahul Azeez).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      313.85,
      401.89,
      472.79
    ],
    "text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute, all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary and desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation includingthe power to open, operate and close bank accounts, toborrow or raise money with or without security,to receive orto collect grants and donations from the Mureedeens,Muhibbeens, followers and well-wishers and to invest itsfunds to construct any buildings on any land vested in, oracquired or held by the Corporation, and to engage, employand dismiss personnel for the purpose of carrying out of theobjects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      486.05,
      401.87,
      546.59
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The Spiritual Heads of the Corporation shall bethe Life Patrons of the Corporation as long as they continueto be such Spiritual Heads His Holiness Assaiyyidh AsshheikhKoya Thangal Al-Qadhiriyyah War-Rifa\u2019iyyah(Qaddasallahu Sirrahul Azeez).",
