    "text": "6.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules in force for the time being fo the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Administration consisting ofsuch number of persons as may be provided for in such rulesand appointed periodically by the Life Patrons at their solediscretion.",
